gin{aligned}8 & 5 & 5 \\\\ 9 & 8 & -4 \\\\ -12 & -9 & -10\\end{aligned}| & =8|\\begin{aligned}8 & -4 \\\\ -9 & -10\\end{aligned}|-5|\\begin{aligned}9 & -4 \\\\ -12 & -10\\end{aligned}|+5|\\begin{aligned}9 & 8 \\\\ -12 & -9\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =8(8\\cdot (-10)-(-4)\\cdot (-9))+(-5)(9\\cdot (-10)-(-4)\\cdot (-12))+5(9\\cdot (-9)-8\\cdot (-12)) \\\\  & =8(-80-36)+(-5)(-90-48)+5(-81-(-96)) \\\\  & =8\\cdot (-116)+(-5)\\cdot (-138)+5\\cdot 15 \\\\  & =-928+690+75 \\\\  & =-163\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534246 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb6d018c-ba33-52b5-b3d7-aa5783cc6736" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1022" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534252}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1022" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534252} :answer-field/id #uuid "7ab18f7c-f40c-5379-93c7-a7f21c1e6cce" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534232}] :question/id #uuid "d662af0a-b4d4-5653-a75a-192a84ba886b" :question/problem "If $Q=[\\begin{aligned}7 & -7 & 9 \\\\ -7 & -7 & 7 \\\\ 12 & -12 & 5\\end{aligned}],$ then $det(Q)=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}7 & -7 & 9 \\\\ -7 & -7 & 7 \\\\ 12 & -12 & 5\\end{aligned}| & =7|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 7 \\\\ -12 & 5\\end{aligned}|-(-7)|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 7 \\\\ 12 & 5\\end{aligned}|+9|\\begin{aligned}-7 & -7 \\\\ 12 & -12\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =7((-7)\\cdot 5-7\\cdot (-12))+7((-7)\\cdot 5-7\\cdot 12)+9((-7)\\cdot (-12)-(-7)\\cdot 12) \\\\  & =7(-35-(-84))+7(-35-84)+9(84-(-84)) \\\\  & =7\\cdot 49+7\\cdot (-119)+9\\cdot 168 \\\\  & =343-833+1512 \\\\  & =1022\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186534251 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "003496f1-3b51-50b5-b886-d6d3f3efcc21" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1839" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534215}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1839" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534215} :answer-field/id #uuid "2d8282c0-97d4-5fb5-b9eb-de5bff7453bc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186534222}] :question/id #uuid "f47007bd-5cbd-5756-890b-9b75cb25d807" :question/problem "If $W=[\\begin{aligned}-9 & 9 & 8 \\\\ 12 & 8 & -5 \\\\ 6 & 5 & 8\\end{aligned}],$ then $det(W)=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}-9 & 9 & 8 \\\\ 12 & 8 & -5 \\\\ 6 & 5 & 8\\end{aligned}| & =(-9)|\\begin{aligned}8 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{aligned}|-9|\\begin{aligned}12 & -5 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{aligned}|+8|\\begin{aligned}12 & 8 \\\\ 6 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-9)(8\\cdot 8-(-5)\\cdot 5)+(-9)(12\\cdot 8-(-5)\\cdot 6)+8(12\\cdot 5-8\\cdot 6) \\\\  & =(-9)(64-(-25))+(-9)(96-(-30))+8(60-48) \\\\  & =(-9)\\cdot 89+(-9)\\cdot 126+8\\cdot 12 \\\\  & =-801-1134+96 \\\\  & =-1839\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Determinant of a 3x3 Matrix"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059848 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059453 :question/id #uuid "d7516cec-bd96-59db-98cd-5d82e41fa719" :question/math-academy-id "e-14763" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $A$ given below?\n\n- $\\det(A) = 0$\n\n- $A$ is **not** a singular matrix\n\n- $A$ is a singular matrix\n\n![](images/21/21cd71e00c682ad1117b9ae126adcbeb8e4c55769c73eae1e1169534f2a01d4a.png)" :question/worked-solution "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 7\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 7\\end{aligned}|-2|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{aligned}|+3|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1(0-4)-2(7-3)+3(4-0) \\\\  & =-4-2\\cdot 4+3\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =-4-8+12 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $\\det(A)=0$, the matrix is singular. \n\nTherefore, only statements I and III are true."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "32df8909-a239-5167-b8ea-412f7cdaea93" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186529256 :question-generator/id #uuid "767e3ed7-87a9-555f-b96e-fdfc64601da4" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186059848.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060020 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bc68d302-4e05-53f4-a13b-62357c5a7653" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439477} {:answer/id #uuid "3bd87d1e-fd23-5dab-bc43-900e69f9433c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439478}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439477} :answer-field/id #uuid "91107b81-23d7-5b15-b57e-bf4ab1565fe8" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440096} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "70ca64ce-81b4-5636-ba58-791451017b65" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439479} {:answer/id #uuid "e05c2887-d7f6-57d2-a4c2-2f2da18a616f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439480}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439479} :answer-field/id #uuid "c2548bbb-9529-57ff-80c9-7eb2135baee7" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440097} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b319f9de-b31e-5b7f-b008-19047e4bc681" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439481} {:answer/id #uuid "7743ec0d-8e7c-52c8-b5bf-a2c3ff1639ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439482}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439482} :answer-field/id #uuid "d3fd9d3c-6b34-5cd5-b3aa-e7329f24b386" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440098}] :question/id #uuid "d0d9bc49-c94e-5174-9068-2abf75c42684" :question/math-academy-id "q-128490" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $M$ given below?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $det(M)=10$\n- **II.** $det(M)=-5$\n- **III.** $M$ is a singular matrix\n\n \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 0 & 3 & 5 \\\\ -3\\sqrt{5} & 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 0 & \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 0 & 3 & 5 \\\\ -3\\sqrt{5} & 3 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}|\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}|-0|\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ -3\\sqrt{5} & 4\\end{aligned}|+\\frac{1}{3}|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ -3\\sqrt{5} & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}(12-15)-0+\\frac{1}{3}(0+9\\sqrt{5}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}\\cdot (-3)+\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 9\\sqrt{5} \\\\  & =-3\\sqrt{5}+3\\sqrt{5} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince $det(M)=0$, the matrix is singular. \n\nTherefore, only statement III is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060454 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "141d3bda-708e-5cd1-a9c3-33813075f0e7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438670} {:answer/id #uuid "c97bfd73-22d0-514a-b96a-af8b07567307" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438671}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438671} :answer-field/id #uuid "e441ef7a-f7d8-556c-897f-7d0c7a6b2bc1" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439364} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aa853019-8cb7-57bb-8d89-07bb087c8654" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438672} {:answer/id #uuid "5e56b566-9992-53f1-aacf-331d0f084061" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438673}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438673} :answer-field/id #uuid "e6cc4081-efb3-5cbd-91d9-77bb4d9690f4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439365} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1db0c840-997f-55b7-bab1-3572f80549a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438674} {:answer/id #uuid "9da77c68-30c2-574d-8a12-c8183bf926de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438675}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438674} :answer-field/id #uuid "3e1cd461-5747-5d77-9466-83683a668421" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/r